msgid_plural "%d photographies attendent votre décision : associez-les à une recette, faites-en des recettes ou écartez-les."
msgstr[0] "One photograph needs your decision: pair it with a recipe, make it a recipe, or set it aside."
msgstr[1] "%d photographs need your decision: pair them with a recipe, make recipes of them, or set them aside."

